Bharata mounts best chariot craving Rāma sight --- Ministers priests follow on sunlike chariots --- Nine thousand elephants sixty thousand chariots and hundred thousand horses follow --- Mothers and glad citizens recount Rāma tales --- Artisans merchants actors and thousands of brāhmaṇas follow --- Glad army halts with Bharata at holy Gaṅgā --- Bharata orders camp and tomorrow crossing --- Bharata offers river water for father and ponders Rāma return
